      <activity id="02dea833-f0de-52ca-8efd-fbbcc49bc0b3" activityNameId="f3a9d8d9-01c3-59b9-b975-34bde99e309f" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, burned in boiler modulating &lt;100kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, burned in boiler modulating &lt;100kW
NOx and CO emissions derived from measurements under controlled conditions;
UUID: 76decb2e-2d66-3bbb-b77b-a6724ff0a7c5
The module includes fuel input from low pressure (CH) network, infrastructure (boiler), emissions to air, and electricity needed for operation.
Location: Natural gas input (low pressure) and emission data extrapolated from Switzerland to Europe (RER).
Technology: Models on market
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature, manufacturers; CO and NOx emissions from (SVGW 2002), sample size (number of selected devices for which emission values are given in SVGW list): CO 28 , NOx 30 . 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_76decb2e-2d66-3bbb-b77b-a6724ff0a7c5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
